<title>UK: New South Wales Treasury Corp sets A$50 mln bond.</title>
<headline>New South Wales Treasury Corp sets A$50 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Nomura.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NEW SOUTH WALES TREASURY CORP</p>
<p> AMT    A$50 MLN	COUPON     3.0	 MATURITY    16.JUL.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  81.952    PAY DATE    16.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS **</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRALIA TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.875     SELL CONC  1.00	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED UNDER EMTN PROGRMME</p>
<p>	    **US/UK/JP/AUS</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
